    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityGymLeaderRoom_Text_9",
      "en_US": [
        "Fantina: Finally, you have arrived!\r",
        "So, you shall challenge me.\n",
        "And I shall win.\r",
        "You will be startled by how much\n",
        "stronger I have become!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityGymLeaderRoom_Text_10",
      "en_US": [
        "Fantina: You are an amazing person!\n",
        "Très fantastique!\r",
        "I am delighted--for now I have a\n",
        "purpose!\r",
        "My purpose, it is to defeat you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityGymLeaderRoom_Text_11",
      "en_US": [
        "Fantina: Oh? It is you?\n",
        "Are you not taking part in Contests?\r",
        "Since you are involving yourself in\n",
        "Contests, you should challenge me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityGymLeaderRoom_Text_12",
      "en_US": [
        "{COLOR 2}The level cap is now set to 39.{COLOR 0}\r",
        "You now have access to more\n",
        "move tutors, check your Pocket PC!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityGymLeaderRoom_Text_13",
      "en_US": [
        "Happiny would like to heal your\n",
        "Pokémons, let her do it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityGymLeaderRoom_Text_14",
      "en_US": "HAPPINY: HAP-HAP-HAPPIII!"
    }
  ]
}
